  "app.cloud_account_cloud_accounts_only": "<div class=\"pf-h\">Cloud account</div><div class=\"lbl\">Cloud accounts only work in the web version (this single-file version can't sign in to Google). Open <b>whiterhapsody.github.io/WRbeta</b>, or add it to your home screen. Records are still saved on this device and can be backed up with record codes.</div>",
  "app.cloud_accounts_coming_soon_soon": "<div class=\"cloud-soon\">☁️ Cloud accounts coming soon</div><div class=\"lbl\">Soon you'll be able to sign in with Google and sync records to the cloud, so they won't be lost when you change phones. For now records are saved on this device (back them up with record codes).</div>",
