  "app.apple_relay_email": " (Apple relay email)",
  "app.sign_in_to_the_cloud": "<div class=\"pf-h\">Sign in to the cloud</div><div class=\"lbl\">After signing in, records are backed up automatically to your own cloud space (only you can see it), so you can get them back on a new phone or after reinstalling. You can also use the app without signing in; records stay on this device.</div>{0}{1}",
