  "home.v300_1": "“Ghost” is replaced by the SIUS-slip screen: a card per 10 shots, every field editable, swipe sideways or scroll down",
  "home.v300_2": "New recognition engine: yellow still counts and saves, red must be fixed first; all three babies read SIUS slips",
  "home.v300_3": "Buttons tuck away after 1.8 s with new animations; the baby asks when it can’t tell the target",
  "home.v300_4": "Choose a font (Zev Hei) in Settings; send beta-test reports to improve reading",
  "home.v301_1": "Pistol qualification compares whole numbers: the X/Y score is rounded down (8.0–8.9 counts as 8), subtotals too; backup-engine shots can go green when they match",
  "home.v301_2": "Opening a shot to edit no longer pops up the keyboard; tap a field when you want to type",
  "home.v311_1": "Owner tool \"Upload photos to Drive\" is now live: the first tap opens a Google sign-in window, and photos go to a daily folder in your Drive (created automatically)",
  "home.v310_1": "Take several photos, then tap Start analysis: each row is voted across photos, and later photos skip sections that are already green. One photo is enough; more is more accurate",
  "home.v310_2": "Shots with a score but no coordinates can be saved and the score counts (marked \"no XY\"; the dashed estimated hole is left out of analysis). When score and coordinates disagree the score wins, marked yellow; a missing score is calculated from coordinates or the subtotal and underlined",
  "home.v310_3": "Better slip reading: fixed column bands, zoomed re-reads where a row looks missing, arrows masked before OCR, a pixel check for minus signs on Y, and a missing minute tens digit filled from the neighbouring shots",
  "home.v303_1": "A slip that's all sighters (P, no Match, subtotals or total) is treated as practice: every shot is a sighter, it can be saved, and there are no more 60 empty rows or missing-subtotal warnings",
  "home.v303_2": "When the shot number restarts at 1 it's a new group, so same-numbered shots from different groups are no longer merged; the hour comes from the header, so times stay in order across the hour",
  "home.v303_3": "The printed direction arrows now check the X/Y signs and quadrant: a mismatch never shows green, and when another reading fits, it's used and marked yellow for you to confirm",
  "home.v302_1": "Sighters and match shots are separated by time and no longer mixed; when X/Y has two readings, the printed score picks the right one",
  "home.v302_2": "Certain coordinates with a different score now show orange and don't block saving; time gaps and inner-10 counts no longer flag every shot",
  "home.v302_3": "Compact shot editor (tap outside to close, Save = green); trash button to clear this session; the baby animates on any edge",
